		"description": {
			"baseEffect": "<p><strong>Tier 4 · 2 Actions · Range 12.</strong></p><p>Two creatures in Range swap places on a failed INT save. Willing creatures automatically fail. If either was the target of an attack or effect this turn, the other becomes the new target. While Charged or Dying, this spell costs 2 mana and 1 Action.</p>",
